meta {
  name: Post Create Dictionary
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/dictionary
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

body:json {
  {
    "dictionary_type": "trip_category",
    "dictionary_name": "test category"
  }
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Post Create Dictionary

  This request is used to created a dictionary by using given `dictionary_type`, and `dictionary_name`. This request interacts with the MySQL database, and have a protected routes.

  ## Responses

  **201 — Dictionary created successfully**
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "dictionary created"
  }
```

  **400 — Validation failed** (one of the following)
```json
  { "status": "failed", "message": "dictionary name must be at least 2 characters" }
```
```json
  { "status": "failed", "message": "dictionary type must be one of the following values trip_category, vehicle_merk, vehicle_type, vehicle_category, vehicle_status, vehicle_default_fuel, vehicle_fuel_status, vehicle_transmission" }
```
```json
  { "status": "failed", "message": "dictionary_name is a required field" }
```
```json
  { "status": "failed", "message": "dictionary name has been used. try another" }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}